From: Firas Shaari <firas.shaari@shaariconsultancy.com>
Subject: [PATCH] radio.uc: render mu_beamformer=0 into wifi-device

MU-MIMO beamforming causes downlink MCS thrashing on QCA4019
(SPW2AC1200). The schema has no beamforming property, so emit the
uci option directly until a proper schema knob exists.

--- a/renderer/templates/radio.uc
+++ b/renderer/templates/radio.uc
@@ -220,6 +220,7 @@ set wireless.{{ phy.section }}.htmode={{ htmode }}
 set wireless.{{ phy.section }}.txantenna={{ match_mimo(phy.tx_ant_avail, radio.mimo) }}
 set wireless.{{ phy.section }}.rxantenna={{ match_mimo(phy.rx_ant_avail, radio.mimo) }}
 set wireless.{{ phy.section }}.noscan=1
+set wireless.{{ phy.section }}.mu_beamformer=0
 {%  endif %}
 set wireless.{{ phy.section }}.channel={{ match_channel(phy, radio) }}
 set wireless.{{ phy.section }}.beacon_int={{ radio.beacon_interval }}
